  Ceo Sources
  Utah Valley University (UVU) does not have a
  distinct program titled "anticipatory defense," but
  it plays a key role in a collaborative initiative
  focused on emerging security and intelligence
  challenges, sometimes framed as anticipatory
  intelligence 2 9. UVU's Center for National
  Security Studies (CNSS) is a co-leader in the
  Intermountain Intelligence, Industry, and Security
  Consortium (ISC) with Utah State University,
  which includes programming around anticipatory
  intelligence, cybersecurity, security analytics,
  and related fields 2 9 7.
  UVU and Anticipatory Intelligence
  • UVU offers degree programs, certificates,
  and courses through its Center for National
  Security Studies but does not host a formal
  "anticipatory defense" degree or major 5 7
  3.
  • Through the I3SC and with support from the
  Deep Technology Talent Initiative, UVU
  Ask follow up...
